  "description": "After confessing at a high school graduation ceremony, Chan-ran, a piano prodigy and Hye-jun, a former lover of his deceased brother met again at the university. Hye-jun who has not yet forgotten his brother who committed suicide, is still shaken by the splendid voice that resembles his older brother. Hye-jun who is drunk at a dinner party, couldn't help but to fell into the temptation of his hesitant but irresistible brilliance..\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000054445), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12472425), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/my_bros_lover), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1286010532)",
